and charges outside the confirmed quote"],"faqs":[["Can the cab take us on the toy train?","The Nilgiri Mountain Railway is a separate train service. Cab timing can be planned around tickets you have confirmed."],["Can we include Coonoor?","Yes. Tell us your preferred stops and the team will confirm a practical route and quotation."]],"sourceLinks":[{"label":"Incredible India · Ooty","href":"https://www.incredibleindia.gov.in/en/tamil-nadu/ooty"},{"label":"UNESCO · Mountain Railways of India","href":"https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/944"}],"state":"Tamil Nadu"}'::jsonb, true, 1),
  ('yercaud', '/tour-packages/yercaud', 'Yercaud', 'Tamil Nadu', ARRAY['Hill Station Getaways', 'Family Holidays', 'Weekend Trips', 'Outstation Road Trips']::text[], '/tours/generated/hd/yercaud.jpg', '{"id":"yercaud","name":"Yercaud","shortName":"Yercaud","region":"Shevaroy Hills","slug":"/tour-packages/yercaud","hero":"/tours/generated/hd/yercaud.jpg","alt":"High-definition hillside lake and green Shevaroy Hills in Yercaud","duration":"Suggested 2 days","durationDays":"2","category":["Hill Station Getaways","Family Holidays","Weekend Trips","Outstation Road Trips"],"summary":"A quieter hill break with a lake, garden stops and scenic viewpoints.","overview":"Yercaud sits in the Shevaroy Hills and offers an easy mix of lake-side time, viewpoints, gardens and nature walks. Waterfall access and water flow can depend on rainfall and local conditions, so confirm stops close to the travel date.","highlights":["Yercaud Lake","Anna Park","Lady’s Seat","Kiliyur Falls","Botanical Garden"],"attractions":[{"name":"Yercaud Lake","description":"A central sightseeing stop with a boat house and nearby park areas.","image":"/tours/yercaud/yercaud-lake-crop.jpg","alt":"AI-generated illustration of Yercaud Lake","credit":"AI-generated illustrative artwork; not a documentary photograph"},{"name":"Lady’s Seat","description":"A hill viewpoint overlooking the Salem side of the landscape.","image":"/tours/yercaud/ladys-seat-crop.jpg","alt":"AI-generated illustration of Lady’s Seat viewpoint","credit":"AI-generated illustrative artwork; not a documentary photograph"},{"name":"Pagoda Point","description":"A hillside viewpoint to include when weather and visibility allow.","image":"/tours/yercaud/pagoda-point-crop.jpg","alt":"AI-generated illustration of Pagoda Point in Yercaud","credit":"AI-generated illustrative artwork; not a documentary photograph"},{"name":"Botanical Garden","description":"A quiet landscaped stop in the Yercaud hills; check local access before travelling.","image":"/tou