ges outside the confirmed quote"],"faqs":[["Can the driver wait while we visit the temple?","Waiting and parking arrangements depend on local rules and the agreed itinerary. The team will confirm these with your quotation."],["Can we add Dhanushkodi?","Yes, subject to current access, weather and local advisories on your travel date."]],"sourceLinks":[{"label":"Incredible India · Sri Ramanathaswamy Temple","href":"https://www.incredibleindia.gov.in/en/tamil-nadu/rameswaram/sri-ramanathaswamy-temple"},{"label":"Ramanathapuram District · Pamban Bridge","href":"https://ramanathapuram.nic.in/tourist-place/pamban-bridge/"}],"templeLink":true,"state":"Tamil Nadu"}'::jsonb, true, 3),
